  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 5737,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "@nickcas discovered that it was possible to view all the team members of a program through a JSON response that is sent when a user is invited to collaborate on a report (via the `/invitations/<token>` endpoint). He was able to provide a very clear PoC, which consisted of a list showing all the members of the HackerOne security program. We resolved the issue by removing the unneeded information from the response in the case of collaboration requests.",
